WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
If you take a blood thinner medication, you may need to adjust your timing

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.960
before the procedure.

3
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.640
Blood thinners can affect our ability to safely address anything we find during

4
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:09.760
your colonoscopy,

5
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.840
so getting the timing right matters. Please contact your doctor's office as

6
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:14.800
soon as possible

7
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.580
if you haven't already discussed this with them. Do not stop or change your

8
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.680
blood thinner on your

9
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.340
own — they will give you specific instructions based on your medication and your

10
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.160
personal health

11
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.680
history. This is an important one, so please don't wait on it.
